Package: printqueue
Version: @VERSION@
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PrintQueue Project
Depends: cups-client, libxkbcommon0
Suggests: libreoffice, printqueue-dolphin, printqueue-nautilus
Description: Collect documents and print them as one job
 PrintQueue converts office documents and images to temporary PDF files and
 submits them to CUPS as a single print job.
